d in three times tonight.", "The guestbook was full of his signature. Page after page. Dates going back years.", "Down the hall, three of him walked toward the same door.", "If a hotel hallway ever feels too long, turn around early.", "Jay is still walking. Room four fourteen is at the end of the hall."]}